    <marc:datafield tag="520" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
      <marc:subfield code="a">By practicing the Noble Eightfold Path, one understands the truths of suffering, emptiness, impermanence, and non-self in the world, and the law of karma, one can follow karma without being bound by it, so as to be able to follow karma without changing, and to follow karma without changing, so as to be able to recognize the dharmas of the world, and to be able to realize the first meaning without moving, and then to be at peace, and to be able to live with a life of openness and wisdom.</marc:subfield>
